    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Chanel has just unveiled its 2026 Fall/Winter pre-collection, and the new bags continue the house's iconic double-C logo, quilted patterns, and leather-woven chain straps. A vibrant palette of lemon yellow, avocado green, blush pink, ocean blue, burgundy, caramel brown, and more captures the transition from high summer to early fall. With an array of silhouettes, these bags effortlessly shift from sharp office wear to laid-back androgynous looks to elegant evening ensembles, fitting seamlessly into every moment of daily life.",
