    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A chain clutch debuts in a soft, sunny milk-yellow tone, crafted from supple lambskin with diamond quilting and a leather-woven chain strap. Its crescent shape is petite and charming. The Chanel 25 small handbag, drawstring pouch, chain wallet, and pear-shaped 🍐 bag charm arrive in pistachio green—fresh and full of vitality. The Maxi flap bag is rendered in avocado green suede calfskin, offering a low-saturation green that feels both comfortable and soothing.",
