    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The shopping bag is shaped from ocean blue suede-effect calfskin with a spacious silhouette, subtly adorned with oversized double-C logos and diamond quilting for a laid-back, languid feel. The 11.12 flap bag appears in peacock blue quilted lambskin or red grained calfskin, with high-saturation hues that add a glow to early-fall outfits. The leather-strap clutch takes a compact square shape with long double straps, and V-shaped quilting infuses it with vintage charm. The small bowling bag is made from white calfskin, its rounded silhouette and arched top handles evoking a youthful, preppy style. The double-C logo leather charm features black stitched edges, resembling a delicate sketch.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
