    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Earth tones and black are perennial wardrobe staples. The new flap bag in camel or dark brown lambskin features wavy quilted patterns, exuding a vintage, artistic vibe. The shopping bag arrives in deep brown, burgundy, or classic black, with a streamlined silhouette that balances utility and elegance. The small tote is crafted from black-and-white canvas with irregular vertical jacquard textures that resemble falling raindrops, adding a poetic touch. Iconic shapes like the Gabrielle bag, flap bag, bucket bag, and bowling bag are rendered in timeless black with the signature double-C logo, embodying enduring style.",
